# Line joins and end caps on ways: bends of thick roads, a road split into
# several ways (at a straight point and at bends), a tertiary and a
# residential road meeting the split points, hairpins, a dead end, a
# roundabout (closed highway ring), and building and pond outlines.
# fixtures/way-joins.osm is laid out on a 10 px grid at zoom 18 around
# (40.7120, -74.0060); see the comment at its top.
#
# Captures: whole scene at 17 and 18, then 19 and 20 around the interesting
# spots. Untagged vertex markers hide corners at zoom 18 and above on builds
# that draw them there.

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/way-joins.osm
viewport 40.711920 -74.005838 17
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-1-z17.png

viewport 40.711920 -74.005838 18
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-2-z18.png

# The split point of the primary road with the tertiary road leaving it.
viewport 40.712080 -74.006648 19
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-3-z19-junction.png

# The roundabout, the minor road ending on it, and the hairpins.
viewport 40.711800 -74.004380 19
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-4-z19-roundabout.png

viewport 40.711400 -74.004812 20
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-5-z20-hairpins.png

# Buildings: L shape and sliver.
viewport 40.713200 -74.004920 20
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-6-z20-buildings.png

# A residential road split at bends, ending in a dead end.
viewport 40.711000 -74.007100 20
wait_idle 5s
capture docs/screenshots/way-joins-7-z20-split-dead-end.png

log done
